scripts that control the build (scripts/build.sh, scripts/sysroot.py,
.github/workflows/build.yml and the checksum list of the recipe at commit
6972a73) and the file SOURCES.md with the sha256 of every file. The same
archives are published by the upstream build at
https://github.com/startabit/avr-gcc-wasm/releases/tag/v1.

This offer is valid for as long as Gatehouse distributes these binaries, and
for at least three years after the last distribution. You can also ask for the
